Description: offline grammar checker and teacher for Kurdish
 Zimanyar finds mistakes in Sorani and Kurmanji, explains each one and
 teaches the grammar behind it, entirely offline.
 .
 The zimanyar command checks files and standard input, with text, JSON
 and SARIF reports and exit codes for continuous integration, applies
 safe spelling fixes, and analyzes, conjugates and declines words. It
 also writes pronunciation and the other script, identifies the
 language of a text, and shows the lessons in the terminal.
 .
 The program carries its own copy of Node.js and its word lists, and
 needs nothing else installed.
